{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "confirm-in-place",
  "title": "Confirm in place",
  "group": "Microinteractions",
  "order": 2,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A destructive action that asks, works and reports inside one pill: rest, then \"Delete 3 files?\", then Deleting, then Deleted with Undo. The pill springs to fit each sentence, so nothing around it jumps and nobody has to deal with a dialog for a small, undoable action.",
    "id": "Aksi berisiko yang bertanya, bekerja, dan melapor di dalam satu pil: diam, lalu \"Hapus 3 berkas?\", lalu Menghapus, lalu Terhapus dengan Urungkan. Pil menyesuaikan lebarnya dengan spring untuk setiap kalimat, jadi elemen di sekitarnya tidak melompat dan orang tidak perlu menghadapi dialog untuk aksi kecil yang bisa diurungkan."
  },
  "titleId": "Confirm in place",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Delete files from a toolbar",
        "desc": "Press Delete 3 files, then Delete. The confirm button ignores clicks for 280 ms after arming, so a double click cannot confirm by accident. Undo stays for 5 seconds.",
        "html": "<div class=\"confirm\" data-lds-confirm>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--rest\"><button class=\"confirm__arm\" data-act=\"arm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete 3 files</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--ask\"><span class=\"confirm__q\">Delete 3 files?</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain\" data-act=\"cancel\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger\" data-act=\"confirm\">Delete</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--busy\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"shimmer\">Deleting</span></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--done\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span>Deleted 3 files<button class=\"confirm__undo\" data-act=\"undo\">Undo</button></span>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Leave a group from its card",
        "desc": "The same walk with words for this action. Escape backs out of the question.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n  <span class=\"avatar avatar--sq\">KS</span>\n  <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 140px;\"><span class=\"card__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Kader Posyandu Sukarame</span><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">12 members, meets on Thursdays</span></span>\n  <div class=\"confirm\" data-lds-confirm>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--rest\"><button class=\"confirm__arm\" data-act=\"arm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">logout</span>Leave group</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--ask\"><span class=\"confirm__q\">Leave Kader Posyandu Sukarame?</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain\" data-act=\"cancel\">Stay</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger\" data-act=\"confirm\">Leave</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--busy\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"shimmer\">Leaving</span></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--done\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span>You left the group<button class=\"confirm__undo\" data-act=\"undo\">Undo</button></span>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Remove a member in a row",
        "desc": "In a list the pill grows toward the row content; the name and email keep their place.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">RS</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Rizal Siregar</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">rizal.siregar@contoh.id</span></span><div class=\"confirm\" data-lds-confirm>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--rest\"><button class=\"confirm__arm\" data-act=\"arm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">person</span>Remove</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--ask\"><span class=\"confirm__q\">Remove Rizal?</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain\" data-act=\"cancel\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger\" data-act=\"confirm\">Remove</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--busy\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"shimmer\">Removing</span></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--done\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span>Removed<button class=\"confirm__undo\" data-act=\"undo\">Undo</button></span>\n</div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Menghapus berkas dari toolbar",
        "desc": "Tekan Hapus 3 berkas, lalu Hapus. Tombol konfirmasi mengabaikan klik selama 280 ms setelah bersiap, jadi klik ganda tidak bisa mengonfirmasi tanpa sengaja. Urungkan tersedia selama 5 detik.",
        "html": "<div class=\"confirm\" data-lds-confirm>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--rest\"><button class=\"confirm__arm\" data-act=\"arm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus 3 berkas</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--ask\"><span class=\"confirm__q\">Hapus 3 berkas?</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain\" data-act=\"cancel\">Batal</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger\" data-act=\"confirm\">Hapus</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--busy\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"shimmer\">Menghapus</span></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--done\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span>3 berkas dihapus<button class=\"confirm__undo\" data-act=\"undo\">Urungkan</button></span>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Keluar dari grup lewat kartunya",
        "desc": "Alur yang sama dengan kata-kata untuk aksi ini. Escape membatalkan pertanyaan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n  <span class=\"avatar avatar--sq\">KS</span>\n  <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 140px;\"><span class=\"card__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Kader Posyandu Sukarame</span><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">12 anggota, rapat setiap Kamis</span></span>\n  <div class=\"confirm\" data-lds-confirm>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--rest\"><button class=\"confirm__arm\" data-act=\"arm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">logout</span>Keluar grup</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--ask\"><span class=\"confirm__q\">Keluar dari Kader Posyandu Sukarame?</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain\" data-act=\"cancel\">Tetap</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger\" data-act=\"confirm\">Keluar</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--busy\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"shimmer\">Memproses</span></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--done\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span>Anda keluar dari grup<button class=\"confirm__undo\" data-act=\"undo\">Urungkan</button></span>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Mengeluarkan anggota di sebuah baris",
        "desc": "Di dalam daftar, pil melebar ke arah isi baris; nama dan email tetap di tempatnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">RS</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Rizal Siregar</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">rizal.siregar@contoh.id</span></span><div class=\"confirm\" data-lds-confirm>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--rest\"><button class=\"confirm__arm\" data-act=\"arm\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">person</span>Keluarkan</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--ask\"><span class=\"confirm__q\">Keluarkan Rizal?</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain\" data-act=\"cancel\">Batal</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger\" data-act=\"confirm\">Keluarkan</button></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--busy\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"shimmer\">Mengeluarkan</span></span>\n  <span class=\"confirm__face confirm__face--done\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span>Dikeluarkan<button class=\"confirm__undo\" data-act=\"undo\">Urungkan</button></span>\n</div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
